    {
      "fact": "alloc_cgroup_ns/new child calls ns_common_init with non-initial pointer; __ns_common_init requests proc_alloc_inum when inum=0. proc_alloc_inum allocates only from PROC_DYNAMIC_FIRST throughUINT_MAX, excluding reserved initial value.",
